School Profile"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/diversity-belonging-inclusion", "Diversity, Belonging & Inclusion"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/our-campus", "Our Campus"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/our-campus/phase-1", "Phase 1 - Innovation Building"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/our-campus/phase-2", "Phase 2 - Pavilion & Elementary Buildings"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/contact-us", "Contact Us"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist", "About NIST"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/contact-us", "Contact Us"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/guiding-statements", ""], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/guiding-statements", ""]], "skipped": [["nav @nav.#", 3546], ["[role=menu] @ul.fsNavLevel2#", 827], ["noscript @noscript.#", 279], ["[class*=\"footer\" i] @div.fsElement fsContent footer-address#fsEl_4006", 211], ["button @button.expander#", 136], ["[role=menubar] @ul.fsNavLevel1#", 76], ["[class*=\"footer\" i] @div.fsElementFooterContent#", 30], ["button @button.#", 20]], "sample": "", "role": "sub", "link_label": "Guiding Statements", "link_score": 3.5}, {"url": "https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist", "title": "About NIST - NIST INTERNATIONAL SCHOOL in Bangkok, Thailand", "lang": "en-US", "vh": 900, "blocks": [[18, "a", -54, 1, 0, "Skip To Main Content"], [50, "h1", 1108, 0, 0, "Head of School's Welcome"], [18, "p", 1228, 0, 0, "It is with great pleasure that I welcome you and your family to NIST International School. NIST is unique in Thailand, being the first full International Baccalaureate World School to offer the Primary Years, Middle Years and Diploma Programmes. Initially established through efforts by United Nations families, NIST remains one of the few not-for-profit international schools in the country with strong ties to the diplomatic community."], [18, "p", 1334, 0, 0, "Although our rigorous academic standards and performance often receive the most attention, we feel that the NIST programme provides a comprehensive and globally focused education for all of our students. Our school is a celebration of diversity, innovation and continuous growth. Our heritage is one of a multicultural, multinational and multilingual community. We have continued to develop our facilities to support new thinking, especially in the areas of science, technology and social entrepreneurship. We are primarily a community of learners who support the pursuit of individual excellence while also exploring ways that we might enrich the lives and experiences of others."], [18, "p", 1498, 0, 0, "We encourage you to browse our website and speak to one of our Admissions team who will answer any questions you may have about our school. Every school bases its success on the collaborative efforts of teachers and parents and we are fortunate to have a community of caring parents to help support us as we aim to provide the best possible education to every student in our care. I hope that you and your family will consider joining our community."], [18, "p", 1633, 0, 0, "Dr. James Dalziel Head of School"], [22, "span", 1751, 0, 0, "Our leadership team engages in continuous professional development through the Principals' Training Center"], [36, "h2", 1898, 0, 0, "About NIST"], [16, "p", 2031, 0, 0, "NIST International School in Bangkok is a not-for-profit full IB World School offering a premium international education. Our commitment to building a community of diverse perspectives and experiences reflects our focus on developing students who are ready and ambitious to positively impact their world at NIST and beyond."], [16, "p", 2154, 0, 0, "Since 1992, we have welcomed thousands of internationally-minded students and their families from around the world. Today our community comprises over 1,800 students aged 3-18 from more than 75 countries. Our holistic education is inspired by our mission of creating inquisitive, lifelong learners and global citizens, empowered by our world-class teachers and curriculum, and enriched by an environment where everyone feels they belong."], [36, "h2", 2372, 0, 0, "NIST at a Glance"], [14, "p", 2739, 0, 0, "average IB Diploma score"], [14, "p", 2739, 0, 0, "home languages offered during the school day curriculum"], [58, "div", 2655, 0, 1, "63%"], [14, "p", 2739, 0, 0, "of students graduate with a bilingual diploma"], [14, "p", 2739, 0, 0, "nationalities in our school community"], [36, "h2", 2967, 0, 1, "Accreditations & Associations"], [18, "a", 3062, 0, 1, "IB World School"], [18, "a", 3148, 0, 1, "CIS (Council of International Schools)"], [18, "a", 3234, 0, 1, "EARCOS"], [18, "a", 3320, 0, 1, "ISAT (International Schools Association of Thailand)"], [18, "a", 3406, 0, 1, "NEASC (New England Association of Schools & Colleges)"], [18, "a", 3493, 0, 1, "ONESQA (Office for National Education Standards and Quality Assessment)"], [18, "a", 3579, 0, 1, "PTC (PRINCIPALS’ TRAINING CENTER)"], [20, "h2", 3992, 0, 1, "Employment"], [18, "p", 4036, 0, 0, "NIST Opportunities: Inspire, lead, and grow. Join the NIST family."], [20, "h2", 3992, 0, 1, "Our Campus"], [18, "p", 4036, 0, 0, "Unveil the inspiring and modern campus: experience an oasis in the heart of Bangkok City."], [20, "h2", 3992, 0, 1, "Academic Performance"], [18, "p", 4036, 0, 0, "Discover NIST’s top academic results, IB courses, and vibrant student life."]], "links": [["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist", "Skip To Main Content"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist", "About NIST"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist", "About NIST"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/guiding-statements", "Guiding Statements"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/strategic-plan", "NIST Strategic Plan"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/our-history", "Our History"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/governance", "Governance"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/leadership", "School Leadership"], ["https://www.nist.ac.th/about-nist/academic-performance", "Academic Performance"], ["https://www.n